{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act5d0_level_act5d0_st02",
  "groupId": "act5d0",
  "stageId": "act5d0_st02",
  "title": "午夜龍門",
  "storyCode": "CB-ST2",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f5effee0b822e490f9d2e02c5f5efb4a5b8759ae58009e27364f74e054a33290",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "0:00 A.M.    天氣/沙塵\n龍門市區，商業街"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你知道你現在的表情很嚇人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你回來了，那些人你調查清楚了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "稍微有一些眉目，雖然很想把那些胡作非為的傢伙繩之以法，但似乎不是我一個人就能解決的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說不定要拜託事務所的那些傢伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對方勢力不小，阿那個傢伙，又不肯直接告訴我，故弄玄虛的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪個傢伙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他就叫阿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦......那，總而言之，不是什麼輕鬆的事情對吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我來幫忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你沒聽明白嗎？如果只是那些混混倒還好說，可如果是一個有組織有規模的幫派組織，我們當然不能輕舉妄動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“不能輕舉妄動”，也不是毫無辦法，對吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你竟然會和我摳字眼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒在開玩笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......阿伯他沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傷不重，但這已經不重要了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——沒錯，的確不重要了。如果只是黑吃黑的案子，我才不想多管閒事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但在我的眼前傷及無辜，我可不能由著他們胡作非為。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......謝謝，之後請你吃魚丸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魚丸就不必了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今晚的事件，也和企鵝物流有關係。他們根本沒打算掩飾，一點都沒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們不是壞人，大概也是被捲進去的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今年到現在已經被捲進去幾十次了？他們應該更注意一點，不要總是惹事生非。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果有機會見到他們，有必要警告他們一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沙子，源石技藝，法術，哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想來也是，掌控龍門暗面的怪物，總不能真的是個花架子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道卡彭先生的意思是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然是最不該招惹的人，不然呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鼠王？但是，我們豈不是要同時對付首領、企鵝物流，還有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有半座龍門。沒錯，情況不容樂觀，所以，一步都不能走錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡、卡彭先生，您這是做什麼？請把弩放下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以為背叛家族真的是一件小事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "願意追隨我在龍門紮根，做好了不惜背叛甘比諾也要活下去的準備，我記得他們每一個人的臉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你並不在其列，甘比諾的走狗，去死吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "滾出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我本以為你只是個忘恩負義的混帳，看來你收買人心還是很有一套的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起來，這還是你教我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我怎麼不記得？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你曾經贏得過我的效忠，再讓我失望至極，我可不會重蹈覆轍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "背叛意味著什麼，你應該明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "背叛是敘拉古最骯髒的罪名，但可惜，你所擁戴的榮譽在龍門毫無價值。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "收下這個吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——黑桃J？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說過，你藏牌的速度太慢了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的劍更遲鈍了，甘比諾，和企鵝物流的廝殺讓你負傷了嗎？還是說，舊傷復發？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的懦弱讓我感到心寒，我只是在考慮怎樣的血腥下場才適合叛徒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在，你才是多餘的那張牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後呢？你打算做什麼？打敗企鵝物流，打敗鼠王，打敗龍門近衛局，再打敗魏彥吾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正都要做夢，不如就別醒了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，至少我會把你的骨灰送回敘拉古。或者，讓你的故鄉把你的屍骸碾成粉末。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "站住，你們是——！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來，有人攪局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沒能快點殺了你是我的錯，但是，先迎接一下外來者吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "攔住他們！唔呃！竟然踩我腳趾......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這傢伙，炎國功夫！？根本碰不到她啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是赤手空拳怎麼做到——噗哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，就是你們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我並不想濫殺無辜，但是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你一路穿過我的隊伍，走到我的面前，衣服都沒沾染上一點灰塵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是鼠王的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你們，剛才在貧民窟？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打斷了西西里人的決鬥，還膽敢發問？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯，那看來就是你們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個傢伙，呃，怎麼回事——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就這麼看著嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別誤會，借刀殺人也未嘗不可，但我必須親自送他上路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是依我看......你也不像是盞省油的燈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我認真建議你投降。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "笑話！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你和那隻狼的身手相當，沒想到鼠王還藏著你這樣的底牌！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼底牌，完全不知道你在說什麼。乖乖趴下和我去見警員吧——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖，我想起來了，我見過你，你是那個偽裝成生鮮販子的打手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真奇怪，我本以為你不是需要特別關注的對象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，那其實是個誤會......算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天，現在，就當我是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喝啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來你被一個小姑娘欺負得很慘，甘比諾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "殺你的事情稍後再提，不要高興得太早。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你有好幾次想要乘機偷襲，卑劣的傢伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拳峰不正，如何取勝？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們會為自己肆意妄為的暴行付出代價。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cenmetery"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你讓我等這麼久，就為了把我帶到這兒來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼意思？開始為我物色墓地了？還是想和我死了之後當鄰居？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你做了這麼多年生意，怎麼嘴巴還是這麼毒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可不會對客人這個態度，你又不是客人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真傷感情啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這是阿發的墓，你也許不認識吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是癩子陳的，這是假閻王的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "後邊住著老吳和鐵瘋子，還有安老八，安老八家裡有錢，給他安置在山坡上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還好，至少都是鄰居。我們也該想想以後的住處了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在想這個還太早了，還是說，你其實得了什麼絕症？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也不早了。我們活得不夠久，所以總覺得自己經歷了很多大風大浪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "像我這種人，兄弟們用命把我們救下來了，過幾天安穩日子，回頭再想想自己這輩子——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像也沒多大個事，畢竟幹大事的，都過不上安穩日子了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "搞什麼，賣個魚丸賣得大徹大悟了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說實話，買菜漲價比黑手黨要命的多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......頭兒，你真不考慮讓我以後做你鄰居？我看這裡風水奇好，聽說墓地聯買會便宜不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夠了沒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "開個玩笑，玩笑。哎，你好歹還有個女兒，我就是個孤家寡人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是有貧民窟的那些孩子跟著你嗎？還有那個叫阿孑的小子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和血親終究是不一樣的，老了之後，才會真正意識到這點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——所以你要活得比我久一點，但也不要太久，稍微久一點就好，我在下面等你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你是鐵了心要找機會嗆我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起來，過會還要再去見個老朋友，要來喝一杯嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不了，我怕阿孑那小子真的去惹事，得去看著點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會幫你看著點的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我還剩幾個活著的老朋友？不都在這兒了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我和姓魏的聊不來，和他打交道久了，真的會短命的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但當年幫魏彥吾擋下一枚流彈，這輩子都沒法直著腿走路的人，是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以為我想嗎？靠，別提這件事，我一直感覺自己虧慘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但至少龍門可以直著腿走路了，也不虧吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你啊，一點沒變，不過這樣也好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要是真的不想見他，就先走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且他見到你，我怕也沒什麼話說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你總算肯放我走了，我好歹也是個傷患，林。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姓董的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒聽見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "活久一點，多賣點魚丸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先考慮在龍門買個門面，開家店，收幾個徒弟，然後再想想棺材放哪兒，不著急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鼠王還活著，輪不到你們送死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "董阿伯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......知道啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
